@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 16
skinparam defaultFontColor #172033
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam titleFontSize 20
skinparam ArrowFontSize 14
skinparam noteFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
title CSRF bootstrap and state-change protection
actor "Session-based client" as Client
participant "CSRF bootstrap endpoint" as Bootstrap
participant "CSRF middleware" as Middleware
participant "State-changing application handler" as Handler
Client -> Bootstrap : Request CSRF token for current session
Bootstrap --> Client : Session-bound token
alt valid token and matching session
 Client -> Middleware : Mutating request with token
 Middleware -> Handler : Continue permitted request
 Handler --> Client : Application result
else missing or invalid token
 Client -> Middleware : Mutating request without valid protection
 Middleware --> Client : Reject before handler execution
end
note over Middleware : Dedicated security tests disable the test-environment bypass
note over Client,Handler : Session CSRF behavior is separate from Git PAT authentication
@enduml
